{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03131","headline":"武司功初有幽庭春暄见贻夏首获见以诗报焉 · 张九龄","name":"武司功初有幽庭春暄见贻夏首获见以诗报焉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳月尽离居，幽怀重起予。\n虽言春事晚，尚想物华初。\n迟日皦方照，高斋澹复虚。\n笋成林向密，花落树应疎。\n赠鲤情无间，求莺思有余。\n暄妍不相待，含叹欲焉如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}